# Cognitive Cybersecurity Assistant (CCA) - Roadmap

## Current Status
- **Phishing Detection Assistant** prototype completed.
- Detects phishing in user-input messages using a trained ML model.
- Streamlit UI with confidence scores.
- Ready for next module development.

---

## Roadmap

### 1. Core Functionality
- [x] **Message-based Phishing Detection**  
  - Analyze user-entered text for phishing.
  - Display prediction and confidence.

### 2. Next Module: Email Inbox Scanning
- [ ] **Email Integration**  
  - Connect to email providers (Gmail, Outlook, etc.).
  - Fetch and display inbox messages.
  - Scan emails for phishing using the existing model.
  - Mark and report suspicious emails.

### 3. User Experience Enhancements
- [ ] **Batch Analysis**  
  - Allow users to analyze multiple messages/emails at once.
- [ ] **Dashboard & Reporting**  
  - Visualize detection statistics.
  - Show history of analyzed messages.

### 4. Feedback & Learning
- [ ] **User Feedback System**  
  - Users can mark false positives/negatives.
  - Collect feedback to improve model accuracy.

### 5. Security & Privacy
- [ ] **Data Handling**  
  - Ensure user data is processed securely.
  - Add privacy policy and data usage notice.

### 6. Deployment & Collaboration
- [ ] **Dockerization**  
  - Containerize the app for easy deployment.
- [ ] **Cloud Hosting**  
  - Deploy on cloud platforms (Azure, AWS, etc.).
- [ ] **Documentation**  
  - Expand README and module docs.
  - Add setup, usage, and contribution guidelines.

### 7. Future Features
- [ ] **Automated Alerts**  
  - Notify users of detected phishing attempts.
- [ ] **Integration with Other Communication Channels**  
  - Support for SMS, chat apps, etc.
- [ ] **Model Updates**  
  - Periodically retrain and update the phishing detection model.

